## USAGE EXAMPLES

### Load Collector Metrics
```python
import pandas as pd
df = pd.read_csv('02_Collector_Metrics.csv')
print(df[['beta1', 'J0', 'J1', 'Jz']].head())
```

### Access Density Matrix
```python
import h5py
import numpy as np
with h5py.File('06_Density_Matrices.h5', 'r') as f:
    rho = f['point_25/rho_ss'][()]  # Middle point
    evals = np.linalg.eigvalsh(rho)
    entropy = -np.sum(evals[evals>1e-10] * np.log(evals[evals>1e-10]))
```

### Plot Logic Performance
```python
import matplotlib.pyplot as plt
data = pd.read_csv('05_Logic_Performance.csv')
plt.figure(figsize=(10, 6))
plt.plot(data['beta1'], data['beta_out'], 'o-', label='Output')
plt.axhline(0.1526, color='r', linestyle='--', label='Threshold')
plt.xlabel('Input β₁'); plt.ylabel('Output β_out')
plt.legend(); plt.show()
```

