## LIMITATIONS & CAVEATS

⚠ **System size**: Limited to N=3 qubits (computational)  
⚠ **Temperature range**: β₁ ∈ [0.5, 4.0] (chosen range)  
⚠ **Perfect baths**: Assumes infinite thermal reservoirs  
⚠ **No decoherence**: Pure Lindbladian (no dephasing beyond dissipation)  
⚠ **Coupling strength**: Fixed g=0.005 (small but non-negligible)

